  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(2024-2025) MAR.S2 Partnerships, mobilization and innovation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNAIDS Secretariat enhances political will, convene strategic initiatives and partnerships, and foster mobilization of sustainable resources. It provides thought leadership, advocacy, knowledge management and communities of practice, and normative and operational guidance, tools and implementation support for a rights-based, gender transformative response&#x2013;&#x2013;including through innovative, community- and youth-led approaches. The aim is to achieve expanded access to HIV services, catalyze action on societal enablers, engender increasingly competent and resilient communities, including in the face of human rights and health crises, and increase accountability from duty bearers to rights holders.</narrative>
  </description>
